%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: BleakFallsDragonTime
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you really think {mc} is going to be alright?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287523
    - rid: 9079474951791575243
    - rid: 9079474951791575244
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki, that's the fourth time you've asked me that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575245
    - rid: 9079474951791575246
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Well, you''ve just been telling me: "yeah" each time.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575247
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Natsuki...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575248
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's because I think he's going to be just fine!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575249
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Why are you worried about him, anyway?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575250
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you not trust Sayori and Yuri to nurse him, or something?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575251
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That's not-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm just worried.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575252
    - rid: 9079474951791575253
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418922
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And I'm telling you, you don't need to be. <i>He'll be fine</i>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575255
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You know, Natsuki...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575256
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I was only teasing you when I said that you liked {mc}...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575257
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But, like...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575258
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You're kind of acting like it right now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575259
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I-I don't-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Ahaha, don't even bother trying to passionately deny it like that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: We both know you often say the <i>exact opposite</i> of what you really
      mean.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575260
    - rid: 9079474951791575261
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So, how do you <i>really</i> feel, Natsuki?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575262
    - rid: 9079475089592287524
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} is a good boy.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575264
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... what?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575265
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika, I know you've gotten candy bars specifically for me before.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418923
    - rid: 9079475089592287525
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575268
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Whenever I'm having a <i>really</i> bad day, you just so happen to have
      a candy bar that you "randomly got and don't want."
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not stupid.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And neither are you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sure you already know my home life is...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yeah.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575269
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well... I guess, maybe sorta...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575270
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: 'But what does that have to do with {mc} being a: "good boy?"'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575271
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... you know how I had to keep my manga in the clubroom?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575272
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What was my reason for that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Because your dad's really strict or something?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ... that's partially true.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: He-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575273
    - rid: 9079475089592287526
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: He's such an <NoiseText=3,1>asshole</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287527
    - rid: 9079474951791575276
    - rid: 9079474951791575277
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Ever since mom died he''s been all:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '"You need to get all A''s! You need to get into a good college! Stop
      reading those children''s books!"'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: He says all that, but he doesn't even make dinner or clean around the
      house...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: He just comes home <i>late</i> with <NoiseText=3,1>fucking</NoiseText>
      booze on his breath!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And it's just-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I never got along great with the boys to begin with, they would always
      pick on me for being small...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And if even my very own father is total piece of <NoiseText=3,1>shit</NoiseText>,
      why would I ever want to talk to one or be friends with one...!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: But-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} is a <i>good</i> boy.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575278
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: He's so patient...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575279
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure the first time I've ever seen him genuinely mad at me
      was when he yelled at me when I woke up all those draugr-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: And like, looking back, that's a really good reason to be mad, not just
      because I got a C on a test or something.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: But even while he was pissed off, instead of brushing the entire world
      off...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: He turned around to go help Yuri while having the rest of us go to safety,
      and just-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: That's <i>good</i> right? He's a <i>good</i> boy... right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575280
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I, uh, sure?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575281
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You're not really helping your case when it comes to the "liking {mc}"
      allegations; you know that right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575282
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Well, that''s the reason I''m worried about him: he''s a good boy.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575285
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And you're sure you don't like him?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575283
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course I don't, he's ugly.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575284
    - rid: 9079474951791575286
    - rid: 9079475089592287528
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wow!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's really mean Natsuki, besides...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575288
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What? You're gonna tell me that he's hot?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575289
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, no, but-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575290
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Who's not beating the "liking {mc}" allegations now, huh?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Look, he's like a solid 7/10.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575291
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So he's not hot, but calling him ugly? That's just untrue.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575292
    - rid: 9079474951791575293
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Which part do you not like? It genuinely doesn't make any sense calling
      him ugly.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: His nose.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575294
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... his nose?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575295
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, it's really big.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And big noses are bad?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't like 'em. Besides, not only is his nose big, it's also a little
      crooked.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And that's why he's ugly to you? Just his nose?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Look, I may have been exaggerating when I called him ugly...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575296
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: But he's seriously just not my type.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575297
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Even if his personality has convinced you that not <i>all</i> men are
      bad?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575298
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep. I'm just fine being friends with him, and I'm pretty sure he's just
      fine being friends with me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... huh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575299
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575300
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So what is your type anyway-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575301
    - rid: 9079475098267418924
    - rid: 9079474977939128320
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, Captain Monika, what business brings you here?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: I assure you, I have the two-headed chicken situation contained, so if
      that's what you're here for...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, no we're here to deliver the Dragonstone.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575303
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Monika, you know this guy?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575305
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Nope! But I'm pretty sure this is the wizard guy Yuri told us about.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575304
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: The Dragonstone? What happened to my apprentice and her companion?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575306
    - rid: 9079474951791575307
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, he got a nasty bump on his head, so she's helping him recover from
      that right now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: You went into Bleak Falls Barrow and got it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128377
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: Nice work, you're lucky that no one died.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: Farengar, just send me a copy once you've deciphered it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128321
    - rid: 9079474977939128322
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Who was that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128378
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: She never told me her name, but she was the one who found out about the
      Dragonstone and its location.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... huh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, you got your stone, so we'll be heading out now-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128379
    - rid: 9079474977939128380
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: Farengar, Monika, there's been a dragon spotted at the Western Watchtower.
      Follow me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287529
    - rid: 9079474977939128382
    - rid: 9079474977939128383
    - rid: 9079474977939128384
    - rid: 9079474977939128385
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a15860a01600501449a676d719ce3ca0, type: 2}
    dialog: A real dragon- how exciting!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128386
    - rid: 9079474977939128387
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wha-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: What happened, son?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287530
    - rid: 9079475098267418925
    - rid: 9079474977939128390
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: I was patrolling out by the Western Watchtower, and-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: I saw that it was smoking and in ruins.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: When I went closer, Ivar told me to stay away; he said that there was
      a dragon nearby that attacked the tower.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: So, I ran all the way back here as soon as I could...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: You can head down to the barracks, you've more than earned your rest.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Huh. I wonder how sad Sayori would be if she found out that Ivar was
      being attacked by a dragon.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128391
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (... what?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128392
    - rid: 9079474977939128393
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uhh...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: Irileth, Monika. Gather all the guards you can and head to the watchtower.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5301facf4ef9bfe46bdb4745494365d2, type: 2}
    dialog: We cannot tolerate a dragon wreaking havoc on our hold.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: At once, my Jarl.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, of course, totally...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: I've already gathered some of the guard at the city gate, so we should
      meet with them, Monika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128394
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128395
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uh, Monika? How are we supposed to take on a dragon?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418926
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Strength in numbers, I guess?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128397
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (But didn't {mc} say something about the place he woke up being completely
      destroyed by one?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418927
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uhh...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128399
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128400
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Ah, I'm sure we'll be fine, Natsuki.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128401
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (What do you mean we'll be fine-!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128402
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (We're being marched to our deaths out here!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418928
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (With <i>that</i> attitude we are, yeah.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128404
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wha-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128405
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (What does that even mean?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128406
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (It means that assuming we're going to die, means that we're probably
      going to die.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418929
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (What kind of delusional nonsense is-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128409
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e66ba0c6207b7664dbb0b977115f10b2, type: 2}
    dialog: We're here men, watch the skies for any sign of danger.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, good news, Natsuki! No backing out now!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128410
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Monika, you friggin' suck-!)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: A dragon approaches over the horizon.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474977939128413
    - rid: 9079475089592287531
    - rid: 9079474977939128415
    - rid: 9079474977939128416
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Eep!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (It's gonna be okay, Monika <b>they</b>'re here...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475023196979320
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475023196979321
    - rid: 9079475023196979322
    - rid: 9079475023196979323
    - rid: 9079475023196979324
    - rid: 9079475023196979325
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418930
    - rid: 9079475089592287532
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: You know, I can't remember a time where I was able to feel so much pain,
      despite not having much feeling in my limbs.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125473
    - rid: 9079475045585125474
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, so the Western Watchtower shouldn't be </i>too</i> much further
      from here-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125501
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah. It seems the dragon's already there.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125475
    - rid: 9079475045585125476
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: W-w-we shouldn't be here...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125477
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you think Natsuki and Monika are okay?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125478
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: They should be fine... worse comes to worse, they could bunker down in
      the Watchtower itself.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, but-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125479
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nope! No buts!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: H-huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125480
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418931
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: As we get closer, we see a wounded Natsuki crawling toward the watchtower,
      while a few guards and Monika cover her.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125482
    - rid: 9079475045585125483
    - rid: 9079475045585125484
    - rid: 9079475045585125485
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Good news, the dragon's already landed.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori, go see if Natsuki needs immediate attention. We'll probably need
      you after that, though.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sayori does as I say without protest. (Not that I think she would under
      these circumstances.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125486
    - rid: 9079475045585125487
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri, you're on me. Try not to get slashed to bits, please.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, if you're going to be shell-shocked you can go hang out with Natsuki.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri goes to hang out with Natsuki. Huh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125493
    - rid: 9079475045585125492
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright, I guess it's Monika and me for now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125494
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287533
    - rid: 9079475045585125496
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Dragon... hahhh... down...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I take a minute to catch my breath, and lean up against a rock, but when
      I do-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I guess I really am dragonborn, then.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418932
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: -Dragon Soul Absorbed-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 89f7d0b97106b6448939eb57dd9aa235, type: 2}
    dialog: Shor's blood! Are you... dragonborn?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287534
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, yeah, gimme a minute before you get all reverent...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125498
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You alright, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125502
    - rid: 9079475045585125503
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I still feel like crap... but I'm alive!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, what about all that... energy or whatever that flew into you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, that was me eating the dragon's soul.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... is that right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125504
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So, what, did you gain its powers or something?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125505
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I- kind of? It's something like that, but not exactly.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125506
    - rid: 9079475045585125507
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: In the game you can use absorbed dragon souls to unlock new shouts, or
      strengthen existing ones-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But I'm pretty sure that lore-wise there's more to it than that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125508
    - rid: 9079475045585125509
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hi, Yuri. You doing alright?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Uuhhh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I-I'm sorry I d-didn't help-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125510
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, don't worry about it. It all turned fine in the end.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, after the whole spider-debacle, I'm not one to judge.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125511
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you okay, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125512
    - rid: 9079475045585125513
    - rid: 9079475045585125514
    - rid: 9079475045585125515
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I could use some of your restorative juice right about now... but other
      than that I'm fine.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sayori comes over to me, showing off her ever improving magic act.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125516
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So, uh, we just killed a dragon, right? Like it's dead, right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep. This is as dead as dragons get, which is more dead than they usually
      are.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Something, something, immortal souls and what-not.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Hell yeah!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125517
    - rid: 9079475089592287535
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, yeah, please keep all gloating to a minimum.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, come on! I can't think of a better time to celebrate than taking
      down a dragon.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125518
    - rid: 9079475045585125520
    - rid: 9079475045585125521
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Thanks to Sayori's healing, I find the strength to pick myself up from
      my sitting-spot.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, we should probably be heading back to the inn-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 26cd9014ea059be4cadea176300763bb, type: 2}
    dialog: Dohv4k3n!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287536
    - rid: 9079475045585125523
    - rid: 9079475045585125524
    - rid: 9079475045585125525
    - rid: 9079475045585125526
    - rid: 9079475045585125541
    - rid: 9079475045585125542
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: W-what was that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, those were just the Graybeards.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: The who?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287537
    - rid: 9079475045585125550
    - rid: 9079475045585125551
    - rid: 9079475045585125552
    - rid: 9079475045585125553
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Four shouty old men who live on the tallest mountain in Skyrim.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '"Shouty" would be an understatement if we could hear them from all the
      way down here...'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125554
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, well, they're masters of the Thu'um. Which is another way of saying
      they speak dragon very well.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What does speaking dragon have to do with anything?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125555
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Well, all the powers that dragons have: breathing fire and manipulating
      the world, come from their ability to use the Thu''um, to speak their tongue.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So are they dragonborn, too?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125556
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No, you don't <i>need</i> to be dragonborn to use the Thu'um...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But, being dragonborn certainly helps if you don't want to waste decades
      of your life just learning the basics.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And what did they say? Doh-vah-keen?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Dovahkiin, yes. That's the dragon word for dragonborn.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So what do they want?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: For me to come say hi.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That, and to train me in the Way of the Voice.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But I'm hungry! We can't go on another adventure.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125557
    - rid: 9079475045585125558
    - rid: 9079475045585125559
    - rid: 9079475045585125560
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm with ya, Sayori.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We should probably head back to The Sleeping Giant, and get our rest
      for the day.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125561
    - rid: 9079475045585125562
    - rid: 9079475045585125563
    - rid: 9079475045585125564
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I think I speak for everyone when I say it's been a long one...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We start heading down the road to Riverwood, eager to kick back and relax.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475045585125565
    - rid: 9079475045585125566
    - rid: 9079475045585125567
    - rid: 9079475045585125568
    - rid: 9079475089592287538
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
